	abstract = {In the digital age, the integration of new changes and directions of the media and the development of ideological and political teachings in colleges and universities has brought opportunities and challenges for teachers and students to study and think deeply about theories. Based on Virtual Reality (VR) technology, the virtual museum is developed by using Unity3D as the main development tool, C # programming language, and Virtual Reality toolkit. It has interactive functions such as exhibition viewing, text introduction, and video appreciation. It is an effective medium to promote the reform, innovation, and development of the teachings of the ideological and political theory course. It also leverages the strength of Chinese profound history and culture and explains profound theories in simple language. Therefore, the construction of the ideological and political virtual museum is one of the important ways to promote the innovation of ideological and political courses in colleges and universities.  © 2022 IEEE.},
